{"insertText":{"location":{"index":145045,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"text":"Table IX. Paired ROC-AUC Differences Under Frozen Transfer, Fixed Recipe\nNote. X → Y: trained on X, tested on Y with frozen source weights, thresholds and temperatures. C23/C40 = FaceForensics++ DeepFakes at compression C23/C40; CDF = Celeb-DF v2; DFo = DeeperForensics-1.0. ΔAUC = fixed-recipe SwinFusion++ minus comparator. Intervals: 95% percentile intervals from 5,000 stratified cluster-bootstrap draws, not adjusted for multiplicity. Raw p: two-sided rank-based cluster permutation test (5,000 permutations); Holm p: Holm-adjusted within the family; “< 0.005” = Holm-adjusted p below 0.005, including the smallest attainable values. Family: frozen-transfer architecture (m = 18). CDF-target intervals are approximate (9 fake-bearing clusters)."}},
